              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Are there any hidden fees?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>Your written quote spells out everything before you book. Every rental includes 4 cameras (1 fixed fisheye + 3 PTZ with 25x optical zoom and IR), equipment training, 24/7 technical support, solar power/generator, and remote viewing access on your mobile devices or computer.</p>
                <p class="mt-2">Professional delivery and setup are available and are covered in your quote based on your site location and timing.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Do you offer discounts for long-term rentals?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>Rental length is one of the main factors in your quote, and long-term and multi-unit rentals are quoted accordingly.</p>
                <p class="mt-2">We also offer corporate accounts and contract pricing for regular customers.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Setup & Delivery -->
        <div id="setup" class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800 border-b-2 border-blue-600 pb-2">Setup & Delivery</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">How quickly can you deliver a security trailer?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>We offer flexible delivery options:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                  <li><strong>Standard:</strong> Next business day</li>
                  <li><strong>Same-day:</strong> Same-day delivery</li>
                  <li><strong>Emergency:</strong> Same-day emergency deployment for urgent situations</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2">Professional delivery and setup are available throughout the Puget Sound region. Call <a href="tel:2536832288" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">(253) 683-2288</a> to check availability.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">How long does setup take?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>Here's how setup time breaks down:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                  <li>Positioning trailer: 5-10 minutes</li>
                  <li>System activation: 5-10 minutes</li>
                  <li>Basic orientation: 10-15 minutes</li>
                  <li><strong>Total time:</strong> 20-35 minutes</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2">Our trailers arrive pre-configured and ready to operate, with no complex installation or wiring.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">What areas do you serve?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>We serve the entire Puget Sound region:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                  <li><strong>Pierce County:</strong> Tacoma, Puyallup, Lakewood, Federal Way</li>
                  <li><strong>King County:</strong> Seattle, Kent, Auburn, Renton, Bellevue</li>
                  <li><strong>Thurston County:</strong> Olympia, Lacey, Tumwater</li>
                  <li><strong>Kitsap County:</strong> Bremerton, Port Orchard, Silverdale</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2">Professional delivery and setup are available throughout the region.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical & Features -->
        <div id="technical" class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800 border-b-2 border-blue-600 pb-2">Technical Features & Capabilities</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">What technology is included in the trailers?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>Each trailer includes:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                  <li>4 cameras: 1 fixed fisheye for 360° panoramic coverage + 3 PTZ cameras with 25x optical zoom and IR night vision</li>
                  <li>Motion detection and alerts</li>
                  <li>24/7 recording with storage</li>
                  <li>Weather-resistant equipment</li>
                  <li>Solar power/generator</li>
                  <li>Remote viewing on your mobile devices or computer</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2">All equipment is commercial-grade and designed for Pacific Northwest weather conditions.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Do the trailers require power hookups?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>No hookup is required. Power options include:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                  <li>Solar-powered units available (no hookup needed)</li>
                  <li>Battery backup for continuous operation</li>
                  <li>Generator included for extended autonomous operation</li>
                  <li>Standard 110V outlet connection option</li>
                  <li>Generator-compatible for remote locations</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2">Most clients use our solar-powered units with included generator backup for complete independence from site power.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Can I monitor the cameras remotely?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>Yes. Every rental is built for 24/7 self-monitoring with remote viewing on your mobile devices or computer:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                  <li>Secure web portal access</li>
                  <li>Windows desktop app</li>
                  <li>Mobile apps for iOS/Android</li>
                  <li>Real-time alerts for motion detection</li>
                  <li>Download or stream recorded footage</li>
                  <li>Multiple user access available</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2">We provide training on the remote viewing system and 24/7 technical support.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Use Cases -->
        <div id="usecases" class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800 border-b-2 border-blue-600 pb-2">Use Cases & Applications</h2>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">What types of sites use security trailers?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>Common users include:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                  <li><strong>Construction Sites:</strong> Prevent theft of materials and equipment</li>
                  <li><strong>Special Events:</strong> Festivals, concerts, fairs</li>
                  <li><strong>Retail/Parking:</strong> After-hours lot security</li>
                  <li><strong>Industrial:</strong> Warehouses, ports, storage yards</li>
                  <li><strong>Government:</strong> Military bases, public works</li>
                  <li><strong>Emergency:</strong> Disaster response, temporary security</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2">Any location needing temporary or mobile surveillance can benefit.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">How effective are trailers at preventing theft?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>A trailer on site gives you:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                  <li>A visible deterrent that helps stop crimes before they happen</li>
                  <li>Clear video evidence for prosecution</li>
                  <li>Insurance claims support with footage</li>
                  <li>Less vandalism and trespassing</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2">Results depend on the site, but a visible camera trailer makes it a harder target.</p>
              </div>
            </details>

            <details class="bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500 transition-all">
              <summary class="font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Can trailers be moved during the rental?</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 text-gray-600">
                <p>Yes, and that's one of the main reasons to use a trailer:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
                  <li>Relocate as project phases change</li>
                  <li>Move between multiple sites</li>
                  <li>Tow-capable up to 70 mph</li>
                  <li>We can relocate for you (service fee applies)</li>
                  <li>Easy to reposition on-site</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-2">It's a good fit for sites where the risk moves as the work progresses.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Comparison -->
        <div id="comparison" class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-800 border-b-2 border-blue-600 pb-2">Comparison & Alternatives</h2>
          
